MapName=SEOUL 3
Briefing_LAMBERT=LAMBERT - This one should be a cake-walk. Jong Pom-chu is a South Korean chemist, suspected to be working for the North Korean Cabinet Intelligence Bureau. CIA has recently flagged him as someone with the capability to manufacture chemical and biological weapons. If what you discovered in Panama is true, and Jong has been bribing Senor de Medeiros to move illegal cargo through the Canal Zone, odds are good he also has the tools and ingredients. I need you to abduct Jong from Seoul before and North Korean forces manage to pick him up and sneak him out of the country.

